{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fun physics sandbox game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place traps, saws, spikes, and all sorts of weird obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/ab40185bcf28bda7aec3cccea79762f3.poster.avif?t=1768666390\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/ab40185bcf28bda7aec3cccea79762f3.webm?t=1768666390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/ab40185bcf28bda7aec3cccea79762f3.mp4?t=1768666390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit gives you coins, which you can use to unlock even more stuff. You can build whatever you want: from simple jump pads to complete obstacle courses full of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can just mess around or try to break your own record, it's all about experimenting and having fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/977fcfec7c4cd773d74285da8bb41e94.poster.avif?t=1768666390\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/977fcfec7c4cd773d74285da8bb41e94.webm?t=1768666390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/977fcfec7c4cd773d74285da8bb41e94.mp4?t=1768666390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build insane setups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock crazy stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain = Gain</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit pays off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/7593d140b56c7988f6392bc3877f6a5c.poster.avif?t=1768666390\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/7593d140b56c7988f6392bc3877f6a5c.webm?t=1768666390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/extras/7593d140b56c7988f6392bc3877f6a5c.mp4?t=1768666390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885420?t=1768666390","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/5d27817045327944ab7bb889a66550274dc0fe9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768666390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/b483bf0da5532857b8de159fe1a508231f010519/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768666390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885420/b483bf0da5532857b8de159fe1a508231f010519/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768666390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class